      "created_at": "2019-02-11T21:02:41.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Has GtG stated whether sharing the character sheet aspect of the Starter Kit PDF is allowed to facilitate online/play-by-post play? I ask because the character sheet packets have art and a significant amount of system rules so I would assume sharing the files would be a no-go, but at the same time you really can't play without the characters.</p>\n<p>I submitted a question to the company but they are pretty busy and it hasn't been answered yet so I figured I would ask if this had been addressed already.&nbsp;</p>",
