      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/dbc845/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2019-02-11T22:10:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That response sounds like \"it's fine to share but we can't SAY it's fine to share until our legal team writes something official\" and I'm honestly not sure where that leaves me (or anyone else that wants to run a game unless every single person playing owns the Starter Kit).</p>\n<p>The Starter Kit has been out for like a year or more. Have&nbsp;you been actively seeking out and prosecuting online players for using the character sheets?</p>",
